TagLiquidablePositionTest
├── given market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given position is solvent
│   └── it should revert
├── given liquidator is priority liquidator
│   └── it should revert
└── given liquidator is not priority liquidator
    ├── given position is already tagged
    │   ├── when within liquidation window
    │   │   └── it should revert
    │   └── when after liquidation window
    │       └── it should tag position
    └── given position is not tagged
        └── it should tag position 